{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2021-09-09 08:06:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE INTRODUCES ITS FIRST-EVER CREATOR CLASS, GIVES ONE FAN THE CHANCE TO JOIN THE EXCLUSIVE GROUP', 'text': "NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF., SEPT. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE CHIPOTLE CREATOR CLASS, A PROGRAM THAT SUPERCHARGES SOME OF THE BRAND'S MOST INFLUENTIAL CREATORS THROUGH EXCLUSIVE PERKS AND PARTNERSHIPS TO HELP SHAPE THE FUTURE OF CHIPOTLE."}